 Styles:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Basic – 80%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gold – 17%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Radiant – 3%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Versions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Standard – 90%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Full Art – 10%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foil Variants:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Non-Foiled – 95%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Foiled – 5%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Marketplace Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cards in your collection can be listed on the Steam Community Market! You can freely <strong>buy and sell cards</strong> with other players to build your binder, hunt for rare variants, or simply manage your growing collection however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Highlights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Free card packs every 4 hours</strong> – Always something new to look forward to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Fully interactive card binder</strong> – Organize, admire, and display your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Deep customization possibilities</strong> – Rarities, borders, art styles, and foils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Steam Market integration</strong> – Buy and sell with players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• 1,728 collectible card variations</strong> – Will you collect them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Collection Craze</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual collector, a hardcore completionist, or just love the thrill of opening card packs, <strong>TCG Master Trader</strong> is the perf